ENGLISH
=====================================================================

1. WHAT THIS IS
Howler is free software to use, but NOT open source. This license states what you may do with
it. If you do not agree, do not use it.

2. WHAT YOU MAY DO
a) Install and use Howler for free, with no time limit, on your own machines and Assetto Corsa
   servers, for yourself or your community.
b) Let your players view its website and their statistics.
c) Redistribute the UNMODIFIED official installer free of charge (for example, give it to a
   friend or link it from your community), keeping this license with it.
d) Create and share MODULES, THEMES and LAYOUTS using Howler's official formats and API. What
   you create is yours: you may license it as you wish, even sell it, provided it contains no
   Howler code, does not pass itself off as official and is not harmful.
e) Use Howler on a server that receives donations or subscriptions from its players, as long as
   you do not charge for Howler itself.

3. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO
a) Modify, adapt, translate (other than through the official language mechanisms) or create
   derivative works of Howler, except modules, themes and layouts as in 2.d.
b) Decompile, disassemble or try to obtain the source code, except to the extent the law
   expressly allows despite this agreement.
c) Sell, rent, sublicense or charge for Howler, include it in a paid product or service, or
   charge for installing it as if it were a product.
d) Distribute modified versions, or versions with another name, another logo or without this
   license.
e) Remove or change copyright notices, the name "Howler" or its logo.
f) Present a different program, or a modified copy, as Howler or as official.

4. NAME AND LOGO
The name "Howler" and its logo belong to ElPatata and are not granted by this license. Their use is
governed by docs/TRADEMARK.md.

5. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
Howler includes third-party components under their own licenses (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES). The
server add-on (HowlerPlugin) is free software under AGPL-3.0 and is governed by that license, not
this one; its source code is publicly available. AssettoServer is its authors' software and is
governed by its own license (AGPL-3.0).

6. NO WARRANTY
Howler is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. I am not liable for data loss, server
failures or any damage arising from its use, to the extent permitted by law. Back up your data.

7. TERM
This license lasts as long as you comply with it. If you breach it, it ends automatically and you
must stop using and distributing Howler.

8. GOVERNING LAW
This license is governed by Spanish law.
